{"id":"97a43eec-0887-42be-9409-71ef9b0a417b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"d27d3da62bf0fdde","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/runtime-fs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"46890fef48c1c35f55ed3f3943a9a6cadf01158e","start":10715,"end":10759},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","who","=","from","?.","split","(","\"","#","\"",")","[","0","]","??","\"","runtime","\""]},"context":{"before":"ff5945e74a60f396","after":"cae74e452bf6977b"}},"payload":{"text":"Each call counted, not spanned: a debug run's or a linter's file calls are thousands a second (CLAUDE.md, *Spans*,\nhot paths) — by operation and by the worker's link (`from`: eslint, a debugger's, by its kind), with its path and bytes, as the\nmetrics plane's `fs` (fs-boundaries.ts); a failed one apart, as `<op>-failed`.\n(by its kind — `eslint`, not `eslint#3488b734`: a worker started afresh is the same caller)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:20.178Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:20.178Z"}
